sequenceDiagram
  participant IN as Telemetry ingest
  participant ROW as Telemetry row
  participant RT as anomaly_runtime.run_detection_and_persist
  participant EV as anomaly_detection_events
  IN->>ROW: persist reading
  Note over ROW,EV: plant_id required for live anomaly persistence
  ROW->>RT: detectors on stored row
  RT->>EV: insert persisted events if fired
